{"reference":"Isaiah 47","book":"Isaiah","chapter":47,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Isaiah’s Textual Witnesses","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The Great Isaiah Scroll is an almost complete manuscript witness to all sixty-six chapters of Isaiah. It broadly aligns with the Masoretic tradition, though it also contains thousands of spelling and substantive differences; other Qumran Isaiah manuscripts and interpretive writings show that Isaiah’s text was actively transmitted and interpreted.","confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed","provenance_refs":["reader_path_isaiah_047_e6e412864ade150a54749b59"]}]}],"generated_metadata":null}